    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        385,
        1557,
        1534,
        1902
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "RESOLVED THAT the reductions, pursuant to such section 70-a, as so amended, in the contributions of members of such Retirement System in the employ of the Brooklyn Public Library, shall be made beginning with the pay roll period commencing on April 1, 1963; it being the intent of this resolution that the reductions in the contributions of such members provided, pursuant to L. 1963, c. 54, shall succeed without interruption, the reductions provided for such members, pursuant to L. 1962, c. 104, by the resolution of this Board of Trustees approved by resolution of the Board of Estimate on May 24, 1962 (Cal. no. 364-j).",
